                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Iboŋokini ijo da kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT Ekonideke kinera atiar,, Esiriat loaapikinit aolior ŋes arai papaka, abu kijesar Misiri, kiboiororoi kaŋina, koraas luekidioko; koluor kaŋina ateker naepol, nakagogoŋon, naelal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
